    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      355.28,
      539.88,
      408.56
    ],
    "text": "Teak Trees 25-30 years old and a Toilet; First Claimant: Kanagasabe Rajamani, Kanapathi Hotel, Munneshwaram, Chilaw; Extent: 0.2240 Hectare. .",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      409.76,
      539.85,
      529.28
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretariat of Chilaw on the 19th day of November, 2018 at 10.00 a. m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 31st day of October 2018, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, and the details of the computation of such amount.",
